ck yet, but let me know if it works properly! About the demo: - Playtime greatly depends on your style of playing. The intended gameplay with upgrades will take between 1 to 2 hours. With no upgrades it can take about 8 hours. - Supports mouse, touchscreen, and partial keyboard input. Th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-13T05:37:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262698874","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:08:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5130980-1842212951308895","game_id":"steam-5130980","kind":"announcement","title":"1000 wishlists - thank you!","summary":"Thanks to everyone, the game has reached 1,000 wishlists in 4 days! Announcing a game is one of the most dreaded part of game development, You never really know, until you finally hit that “Publish” button, whether people will discover your game or if it will simply get buried under the millions of other games being released every day. Thanks again for wishlisting and leaving so many positive comments about the web demo on itch io. I know the current game scene is flooded with low-effort increme","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-31T02:41:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951308895","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:08:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5130980":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-25T22:59:30Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-25T22:59:29Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5130980":"2026-10-25T22:59:30Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5130980":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-25T22:59:29Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-25T22:59:29Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5198290":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-25T22:59:30Z","last_success